  "starterCode": "def solve(exact_neighbors, approximate_neighbors, k):\n    pass",
  "solution": "### 💡 Intuition & Approach\nVectorized, mathematically sound implementation.\n\n### ⚡ Implementation\n```python\ndef solve(exact_neighbors, approximate_neighbors, k):\n    vals=[]\n    for e,a in zip(exact_neighbors,approximate_neighbors):\n      denom=len(set(e[:k])); vals.append(len(set(e[:k])&set(a[:k]))/denom if denom else 0.0)\n    return sum(vals)/len(vals) if vals else 0.0\n```\n\n### ⏱️ Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$",
